  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 4801.01 Purpose. The purpose of these rules is to manage the reporting and auditing requirements for the payments of the automotive oil fees, and the motor oil discharge cleanup fees to the state of New Hampshire.\n\nSource. #6006, eff 3-24-95, EXPIRED: 3-24-03\n\nNew. #8103, INTERIM, eff 6-18-04, EXPIRES: 12-15-04; ss by #8151, eff 8-30-04; ss by #9380, eff 1-30-09; ss by #10022, eff 11-9-11; ss by #13039, eff 4-20-20",
